### Skip the JPEG shortcut when its toggle is off

**Severity:** `medium`

This appends the JPEG shortcut whenever the parent **Paste as file** group is shown, even if the JPEG action itself is disabled. Advanced Paste only exposes the action when both the group and the child toggle are enabled, so Shortcut Guide can currently advertise a shortcut that does nothing.

```suggestion
                    if (advancedPasteProperties.AdditionalActions.PasteAsFile.PasteAsJpgFile.IsShown)
                    {
                        content.Append(HotkeySettingsToYaml(advancedPasteProperties.AdditionalActions.PasteAsFile.PasteAsJpgFile.Shortcut, SettingsResourceLoader.GetString("AdvancedPaste/ModuleTitle"), SettingsResourceLoader.GetString("PasteAsJpgFile/Header")));
                    }
```
